{
 "zone": "corr",
 "text": {
  "az": "Amma bilirsən, bu sarayın maraqlı tərəfi təkcə hökmdarların yaşayışı deyil.\nBurada həm də məscid, hamam, türbələr və su anbarı olub.\nYəni saray öz daxilində kiçik bir dünya kimi idi.",
  "en": "Let's go down a little, to the lower courtyard.\nHere is the tomb of the Shirvanshahs. Shah Khalilullah I built it in 1435 for his family: his mother and his young son.\nThink about that for a second. One of the most powerful men of his time, building a quiet stone room for the people he loved most.\nLook up at its portal. Tall, carved, proud. But inside, it's simple and still."
 },
